  "description": "Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD) credential authenticator for Orleans.Lattice.Membership. Specializes the built-in JWT authenticator with tenant-aware OIDC/JWKS discovery and signing-key rotation, Entra v2.0 claim conventions (oid subject, tid tenant, groups, app roles), single- and multi-tenant issuer allow-listing, and pluggable groups-overage resolution. Keeps the Entra dependency stack out of the core membership package.",
